Guy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ethan1996/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 158, "playtime_forever": 13498, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 541, "last_played": 1697498852, "avatar": "ae408686d27b730245054a77aee9e975a21b9534"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "left 4 dead系列的精神续作，但其实并非原团队。勉强能玩，但是远远比不了原作。", "timestamp_created": 1690738636, "timestamp_updated": 1690738636, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 18, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.631374955177307129", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143088253", "author": {"steamid": "76561199195685256", "personaname": "M默弦M", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199195685256/", "num_games_owned": 1543, "num_reviews": 169, "playtime_forever": 1800, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1346, "last_played": 1693403027, "avatar": "88bb81b181bf7c2968ff676a3f1bfaafc477214b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "虽说是碰瓷求生之路，但游戏本身质量也过硬，枪械手感、卡组搭配、配件组合、特感BOSS、地图设计都很不错，但是核心问题是内容对不起原价，本体流程只有七个小时左右，能看到不少求生地图的影子，而且存在很多地图重复使用的情况。游戏机制相较于求生更强调正面战斗，缺少求生的近战迂回，角色和敌人的机动性的提高加之外伤机制使得整体节奏非常快且容易暴毙，过于注重正面战斗以至于一定程度上让地图设计显得可有可无，总是忙于应付战斗而不关心地图本身。另外，制作组似乎没有把握好游戏节奏，特感的出场较于求生更为频繁，玩家必须时刻保持注意力集中，较高难度下与路人队友或者AI队友组队的体验非常差。\n不过总的来说，打折时候还是很推荐买来与朋友开黑。另外，季票很值得买，新地图、新敌人和新玩法远远甩开本体。", "timestamp_created": 1690729037, "timestamp_updated": 1690729037, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.551997125148773193", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143083423", "author": {"steamid": "7656119916947863